%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-random (関数ページ)
実行ごとに変わる部分は %%% mask / %%% env / %%% variants で扱う (docs/fixtures.md)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
{ price: random() * 1000 }
%%% mask
"price": ([0-9.E-]+)
%%% output application/json
{
  "price": 695.0941452765638
}
